'''Mami Tomoe''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 291
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Mami Tomoe
|name2 = Mami & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mami & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mami Tomoe is an excellent Long Distance unit, standing at a very safe range of 475, along with a great piercing range (reaches up to 700) and a moderately small blindspot. Her base DPS is also great for a unit with both her standing range and Long Distance, even better than certain Long Distance units like [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Megaphrodite]], making her a solid pick even against enemies that aren't Angels.

She excels against Angel enemies, since, thanks to her range, she can take out both small peons like [[Gabriel]] and larger Angelic threats such as [[Angelic Sleipnir]], [[Chickful A]], and [[Winged Pigge]]. However, you must be wary when using her against fast pushers, like [[Angelic Gory]] or [[Boraphim]], as they can easily invade her blindspot unless CC units and meatshields keep them within her line of fire.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Sniper}}

